--[[
    VexUI v2.0  (FULL REWRITE - same public API, fixed + improved)

    Highlights
      - Theme system: smooth tween, Accent color, 8 built-in themes, AddTheme/SetTheme/GetThemes
      - Scrolling: AutomaticCanvasSize everywhere, no manual CanvasSize conflicts, touch-friendly
      - Mobile: topbar-only dragging, bigger touch targets, auto scale on viewport change,
                slider locks page scroll while dragging
      - Search: jumps to the element and highlights it
      - Notifications: stacking, progress bar, click to dismiss, optional Type
      - No more global leaks, connections cleaned on Destroy, OnDestroy callback works
]]

